Byte-for-byte a resend of 01-plain-text.eml, and in particular it carries the same
Message-ID.

Send it after the first poll has run and no second case should appear: the plugin already
holds a claim on `msgid:<fixture-01-plain-text@example.org>` in imap_mail_processed, so this
copy is recognised as a duplicate, counted as skipped, and marked read.

This is the guard that matters when a mailbox is polled by more than one node, or when
post-processing failed after a case was already created.
